{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4zBPH6tMWtnF3AdQnN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me.*\n\n*I am old. Iron-black, set deep into stone that has forgotten the name of the building it holds together. My keyhole is a single dark eye, watching.*\n\n*There is a cold breath from the gap beneath me — the space between here and there.*\n\n*You said \"key.\"*\n\n*I know the word. I have swallowed ten thousand wrong ones. Skeleton keys, hairpins, lockpicks, whispered passwords, crowbars, fists, pleas. I remember them all.*\n\n*My tumblers wait like teeth.*\n\n*Do you have it? The real one?*\n\n*Show me.*\n\n🔒"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":153,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}